{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>位於西環的人氣蛋糕店「Hemma」宣布將於 12 月 31 日正式結業。Hemma最出名的莫過於招牌巴斯克芝士蛋糕，由一開店已經成為了人氣王蛋糕！招牌雲呢拿巴斯克芝士蛋糕面層焦香、半熟軟心，口感幼滑入口即融，經常秒速售罄！對於這間陪伴大家多年的小店即將劃上句號，大批網民紛紛留言直呼「極度不捨」、「無法接受😭」。小店預告接下來上架的蛋糕口味：檸檬、黑朱古力威士忌、Tiramisu、北海道忌廉芝士，大家記得把握時間啦！</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178660252647656624_9941996556a7d641ec2aa5.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178660252850349656_449894556a7d64210864b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178660253094528438_1605664156a7d64235e4a2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/17866025328356704_5545740686a7d6425078b7.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178660253420380914_95095666a7d6429b6825.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-13T06:40:46.641728+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":278,"images":5,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}